{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方的大号紫色问句“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”，字号最大、颜色醒目；随后注意到上方白色短句“以后也不变”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"正在犹豫要不要少袒露自己的心意，似乎想通过收敛表达来避免受伤，具体缘由不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"害怕疼痛、犹疑、自我保护，带有一点无奈。\",\n  \"missed\": \"具体经历是刚握到手里才发现留不住，曾坚定地说“是”却又马上产生怀疑；幸福并未消失，但悲伤逐渐进入幸福之中。这些情绪变化需要读下方正文才能获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方白色短句和紫色问句都比较醒目，白色短句的具体指向不够明确。\",\n    \"具体触发情境和情绪变化集中在下方较小的连续正文里，需要再看一眼才能了解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4a677843-0abe-43cc-8f4e-db79e4aebdcf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T021650115969Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:17:26.766471+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ff1bda5cf5e1282a48c68ea2b94f0beac9edae096f255092d3d8ed01030b3a58", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we